LK-47 1.0

The neural network built into LK-47 1.0 was trained on data obtained from the
database "master-binpacks" (https://huggingface.co/datasets/official-stockfish/master-binpacks),
files test80-2022-08-aug-16tb7p.v6-dd.min.binpack, farseerT76.binpack and
farseerT74.binpack. Its README describes it as "A stockfish binpack collection
used for Neural Network training".

